### Exemplos para a extensão "REST Client" (VS Code) ou similar
@base = http://localhost:3000/api
@token = COLE_AQUI_O_ACCESS_TOKEN

### Cadastro (o primeiro usuário vira ADMIN)
POST {{base}}/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "Admin", "email": "admin@exemplo.com", "password": "troque-esta-senha" }

### Login
POST {{base}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "admin@exemplo.com", "password": "troque-esta-senha" }

### Criar produto
POST {{base}}/products
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "sku": "CABO-01", "name": "Cabo flexível 2,5mm", "unit": "M", "minQuantity": 20 }

### Entrada de estoque
POST {{base}}/stock/entries
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "productId": "UUID_DO_PRODUTO", "quantity": 100, "unitCost": 2.5, "document": "NF-123" }

### Saída de estoque
POST {{base}}/stock/exits
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "productId": "UUID_DO_PRODUTO", "quantity": 10, "reason": "Consumo interno" }

### Produtos com estoque baixo
GET {{base}}/products?lowStock=true
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Abrir solicitação de serviço
POST {{base}}/service-requests
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Trocar disjuntor da sala 2",
  "description": "O disjuntor desarma ao ligar o ar-condicionado.",
  "priority": "HIGH",
  "items": [{ "productId": "UUID_DO_PRODUTO", "quantity": 1 }]
}

### Aprovar / iniciar / concluir
POST {{base}}/service-requests/UUID_DA_SOLICITACAO/approve
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###
POST {{base}}/service-requests/UUID_DA_SOLICITACAO/start
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###
POST {{base}}/service-requests/UUID_DA_SOLICITACAO/complete
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "resolutionNotes": "Disjuntor substituído." }

### Notificações não lidas
GET {{base}}/notifications?unread=true
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Painel
GET {{base}}/reports/summary
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### ---------- Oficina ----------

### Tipo de serviço
POST {{base}}/service-types
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "Pneus" }

### Serviço com valor
POST {{base}}/services
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "Trocar pneu", "price": 80, "serviceTypeId": "UUID_DO_TIPO", "estimatedMinutes": 30 }

### Cliente (empresa)
POST {{base}}/customers
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "type": "COMPANY", "name": "Transportes Exemplo LTDA", "tradeName": "Exemplo", "document": "11.222.333/0001-81" }

### Acesso ao aplicativo para o cliente
POST {{base}}/customers/UUID_DO_CLIENTE/users
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "Maria", "email": "maria@exemplo.com", "password": "troque-esta-senha" }

### Contrato com tabela de preços
POST {{base}}/contracts
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "customerId": "UUID_DO_CLIENTE",
  "title": "Manutenção de frota",
  "startDate": "2026-01-01",
  "discountPercent": 10,
  "services": [{ "serviceId": "UUID_DO_SERVICO", "price": 60 }]
}

### Registrar um serviço para o cliente (equipe)
POST {{base}}/service-requests
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Troca dos pneus dianteiros",
  "description": "Cliente relatou desgaste irregular",
  "customerId": "UUID_DO_CLIENTE",
  "contractId": "UUID_DO_CONTRATO",
  "services": [{ "serviceId": "UUID_DO_SERVICO", "quantity": 2 }],
  "items": [{ "productId": "UUID_DO_PRODUTO", "quantity": 2 }]
}

### Configurar PIX e a regra de pagamento (gestores)
PUT {{base}}/settings/company
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "pixKeyType": "PHONE", "pixKey": "(92) 99999-1234", "pixCity": "Manaus", "paymentInstructions": "Envie o comprovante pelo chat.", "requirePaymentToComplete": false }

### O que falta pagar (cliente vê só os seus)
GET {{base}}/service-requests/payments/pending
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Registrar o pagamento (equipe)
POST {{base}}/service-requests/UUID_DA_SOLICITACAO/payment
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "method": "PIX", "notes": "Conferido no extrato" }

### Emitir a nota (solicitação concluída)
POST {{base}}/invoices
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "serviceRequestId": "UUID_DA_SOLICITACAO", "notes": "Pago via PIX." }

### Baixar a nota em PDF
GET {{base}}/invoices/UUID_DA_NOTA/pdf
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
